<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Deep in your heart sin has written its scar,</l><l>Come just as you are;</l><l>Though from the Father you’ve wandered afar,</l><l>Oh, come just as you are.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Sinful and guilty, heart broken and lost,</l><l>Come just as you are;</l><l>Think what your ransom on Calvary cost!</l><l>Oh, come just as you are.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Naught of your goodness God’s favor can win,</l><l>Come just as you are;</l><l>Trust in the blood which was shed for your sin,</l><l>And come just as you are.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Come with your heartache, your sorrow and pain,</l><l>Come just as you are;</l><l>No one has come to the Savior in vain,</l><l>Oh, come just as you are.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
